, fortsetter å spilles."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Todas as cenas serão removidas da lista para assistir. O que está sendo reproduzido continua."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Toutes les scènes sont retirées de la liste à regarder. La lecture en cours continue."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"All scenes are removed from the watchlist. What plays keeps playing."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wszystkie sceny zostaną usunięte z listy Do obejrzenia. To, co jest odtwarzane, będzie odtwarzane dalej."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"모든 영상이 시청 목록에서 제거됩니다. 재생 중인 영상은 계속 재생됩니다."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle scènes worden van de kijklijst gehaald. Wat speelt, blijft spelen."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alla scener tas bort från bevakningslistan. Det som spelas fortsätter spela."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"所有短片都将从稍后观看中移除。正在播放的内容会继续播放。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"所有短片都會從待看清單移除。正在播放的內容會繼續播放。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tüm sahneler izleme listesinden kaldırılır. Oynatılan sahne oynamaya devam eder."}}}},"hint_allow_stashy_to_install_apps":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nstashy'nin uygulama yüklemesine bir kez izin ver, sonra Yükle'ye yeniden dokun."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\n请允许 stashy 安装 App 一次，然后再次轻点“安装”。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\n請允許 stashy 安裝 App 一次，然後再點一下「安裝」。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nSta stashy eenmalig toe apps te installeren en tik dan opnieuw op Installeer."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nAutorisez une fois stashy à installer des apps, puis touchez à nouveau Installer."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nPer