our connected hardware in sync with it. Uses a lot of CPU and battery."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Анализирует воспроизводимое видео в реальном времени на устройстве и синхронно двигает подключенное оборудование. Сильно расходует ресурсы процессора и аккумулятор."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analizza in tempo reale sul dispositivo il video in riproduzione e muove l'hardware connesso in sincronia. Usa molta CPU e batteria."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analyseert de spelende video live op je apparaat en beweegt je verbonden hardware synchroon mee. Gebruikt veel CPU en batterij."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analyserar videon som spelas direkt på enheten och rör din anslutna hårdvara i takt med den. Använder mycket CPU och batteri."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analizuje odtwarzane wideo na żywo na urządzeniu i porusza podłączonym sprzętem synchronicznie z nim. Mocno obciąża procesor i baterię."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"재생 중인 비디오를 기기에서 실시간으로 분석하고 연결된 하드웨어를 비디오에 맞춰 움직입니다. CPU와 배터리를 많이 사용합니다."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analysiert das laufende Video live auf deinem Gerät und bewegt deine verbundene Hardware synchron dazu. Braucht viel CPU und Akku."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analyserer den afspillede video live på din enhed og bevæger din tilsluttede hardware i takt med den. Bruger meget CPU og batteri."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analisa o vídeo em reprodução ao vivo no seu dispositivo e move o hardware conectado em sincronia. Consome muita CPU e bateria."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在设备上实时分析正在播放的视频，并让已连接的硬件与之同步运动。会消耗大量 CPU 和电量。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oynatılan videoyu aygıtında canlı olarak analiz eder ve bağlı donanımını onunla eşzamanlı hareket ettirir. Çok fazla işlemci ve pil kullanır."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在你的裝置上即時分析正在播放的影片，並讓已連接的硬體同步動作。會大量使用 CPU 和電池。"}}}},"hint_api_key_configured":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• 已配置"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• yapılandırıldı"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• 已設定"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• konfigurerad"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• konfiguriert"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• ingesteld"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• настроен"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• konfigureret"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• 설정됨"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• konfigurert"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• skonfigurowano"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• configurada"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"•••• configured"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• configurée"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• configurada"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• 設定済み"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"•••• configurata"}}}},"hint_api_key_is_invalid_or":{"localizations":{"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"API 키가 유효하지 않거나 만료되었습니다"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"API-sleutel is ongeldig of verlopen"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"A chave de API é inválida ou expirou"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"API-Schlüssel ist ungültig oder abgelaufen"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ключ API недействителен или истек"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"API-nyckeln är ogiltig eller har gått ut"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{