o icono."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ændrer stashys appikon på iPhone og iPad. Mac-appen beholder sit eget ikon."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"iPhone ve iPad'de stashy uygulama simgesini değiştirir. Mac uygulaması kendi simgesini korur."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"更改 iPhone 和 iPad 上的 stashy App 圖像。Mac App 會保留自己的圖像。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"更改 iPhone 和 iPad 上的 stashy App 图标。Mac App 保留自己的图标。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ändrar stashys appsymbol på iPhone och iPad. Mac-appen behåller sin egen symbol."}}}},"hint_changes_stashy_app_icon_to":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy uygulama simgesini seçtiğin renge değiştirir."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"将 stashy App 图标更改为你选择的颜色。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ändrar stashys appsymbol till den färg du väljer."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"將 stashy App 圖像更改為你選擇的顏色。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ändert das stashy-App-Icon in die gewählte Farbe."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ændrer stashys appikon til den farve, du vælger."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zmienia ikonę aplikacji stashy na wybrany kolor."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashyのAppアイコンを選んだ色に変更します。"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cambia el icono de stashy al color que elijas."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Donne à l'icône de stashy la couleur choisie."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Altera o ícone do app stashy para a cor escolhida."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Endrer stashy-appikonet til fargen du velger."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wijzigt het stashy-appsymbool naar de kleur die je kiest."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Меняет цвет значка stashy на выбранный."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cambia l'icona dell'app stashy nel colore che scegli."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Changes the stashy app icon to the color you pick."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy 앱 아이콘을 선택한 색상으로 변경합니다."}}}},"hint_choose_appearance_of_app":{"localizations":{"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli l'aspetto dell'app."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj appens utseende."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha a aparência do app."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisissez l'apparence de l'app."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"앱의 화면 모드를 선택하세요."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierz wygląd aplikacji."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выберите оформление приложения."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg utseendet til appen."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kies de weergave van de app."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Appの外観を選択します。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle die Darstellung der App."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose the appearance of the app."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige la apariencia de la app."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælg appens udseende."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇 App 的外觀。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Uygulamanın görünümünü seç."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择 App 的外观。"}}}},"hint_choose_rows_on_home_and":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择主页上的行及其顺序。选择一行可显示或隐藏它，或将其上移或下移。每个服务器都有各自的设置。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇首頁上的列及其順序。選取一列即可顯示或隱藏，或將其上移或下移。每個伺服器都會保留自己的設定。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ana Sayfa'daki satırları ve sıralarını seç. Göstermek, gizlemek veya yukarı ya da aşağı taşımak için bir satır seç. Her sunucu kendi düzenini korur."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj raderna på Hem och deras ordning. Välj en rad för att visa eller dölja den eller flytta den upp eller ned. Varje server har sin egen uppsättning."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige las filas de Inicio y su orden. Selecciona una fila para mostrarla u ocultarla, o para subirla o bajarla. Cada servidor guarda su propia configuración."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierz wiersze na ekranie Start i ich kolejność. Wybierz wiersz, aby go pokazać lub ukryć albo przesunąć w górę lub w dół. Każdy serwer ma własny układ."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle die Zeilen auf Start und ihre Reihenfolge. Wähle eine Zeile, um sie ein- oder auszublenden oder nach oben oder unten zu verschieben. Jeder Server hat seine eigene Einrichtung."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli le righe della Home e il loro ordine. Seleziona una riga per mostrarla o nasconderla, o per spostarla su o giù. Ogni server ha la sua configurazione."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kies de rijen op Home en hun volgorde. Selecteer een rij om hem te tonen of te verbergen, of om hem omhoog of omlaag te verplaatsen. Elke server heeft zijn eigen indeling."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"홈에 표시할 행과 순서를 선택하세요. 행을 선택하면 표시하거나 가리거나 위아래로 이동할 수 있습니다. 서버마다 설정이 따로 저장됩니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisissez les rangées de l'accueil et leur ordre. Sélectionnez une rangée pour l'afficher, la masquer ou la déplacer vers le haut ou le bas. Chaque serveur garde sa propre configuration."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha as linhas do Início e sua ordem. Selecione uma linha para mostrá-la ou ocultá-la, ou para movê-la para cima ou para baixo. Cada servidor mantém sua própria configuração."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose the rows on Home and their order. Select a row to show or hide it, or to move it up or down. Each server keeps its own setup."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg radene på Hjem og rekkefølgen deres. Velg en rad for å vise eller skjule den, eller flytte den opp eller ned. Hver server har sitt eget oppsett."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ホームに表示する行とその順序を選択します。行を選択すると、表示・非表示の切り替えや上下への移動ができます。設定はサーバーごとに保存されます。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælg rækkerne på Hjem og deres rækkefølge. Vælg en række for at vise eller skjule den eller flytte den op eller ned. Hver server har sin egen opsætning."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выберите ряды главной и их порядок. Выберите ряд, чтобы показать или скрыть его либо переместить вверх или вниз. Для каждого сервера настройка своя."}}}},"hint_choose_which_gallery_gets_this":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu resmin hangi galerinin kapağı olacağını seç."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇要將此圖片設為哪個圖庫的封面。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择将此图片用作封面的图库。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælg, hvilket galleri der får dette billede som cover."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg hvilket galleri som får dette bildet som omslag."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"この画像をカバーにするギャラリーを選択してください。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisissez la galerie qui reçoit cette image comme couverture."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle, welche Galerie dieses Bild als Cover bekommt."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierz, która galeria otrzyma ten obraz jako okładkę."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kies welke galerij deze afbeelding als omslag krijgt."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige qué galería usará esta imagen como portada."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 이미지를 커버로 사용할 갤러리를 선택하세요."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose which gallery gets this image as its cover."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj vilket galleri som får den här bilden som omslag."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli quale galleria usa questa immagine come copertina."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha qual galeria recebe esta imagem como capa."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выберите галерею, для которой это изображение станет обложкой."}}}},"hint_choose_which_icon_to_display":{"localizations":{"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kies welk symbool overal in de app voor de O-teller wordt getoond."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj vilken symbol som visas för O-räknaren i hela appen."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisissez l'icône affichée pour le compteur O dans toute l'app."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige qué icono se muestra para el contador O en toda la app."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle, welches Symbol in der ganzen App für den O-Zähler angezeigt wird."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælg, hvilket ikon der vises for O-tælleren i hele appen."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha qual ícone exibir para a contagem O em todo o app."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose which icon to display for the O Count throughout the app."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выберите значок счетчика O, который будет показан во всем приложении."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierz ikonę wyświetlaną dla licznika O w całej aplikacji."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"App全体でOカウントに表示するアイコンを選択します。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg hvilket ikon som skal vises for O-telleren i hele appen."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"앱 전체에서 O 카운트에 표시할 아이콘을 선택하세요."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli quale icona mostrare per il contatore O in tutta l'app."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Uygulama genelinde O Sayısı için gösterilecek simgeyi seç."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇在整個 App 中用於 O 計數的圖像。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择在整个 App 中用于 O 计数的图标。"}}}},"hint_choose_which_rows_home_shows":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择主页显示哪些行（短片、演员、工作室、图库、频道）及其顺序。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ana Sayfa'nın hangi satırları göstereceğini — sahneler, oyuncular, stüdyolar, galeriler, Kanallar — ve sıralarını seç."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj vilka rader Hem visar – scener, stjärnor, studior, gallerier, kanaler – och i vilken ordning."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇首頁要顯示哪些列（短片、演員、工作室、圖庫、頻道）及其順序。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha quais linhas o Início mostra — cenas, artistas, estúdios, galerias, canais — e sua ordem."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выберите, какие ряды показывает главная — сцены, исполнители, студии, галереи, каналы — и их порядок."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige qué filas muestra Inicio (escenas, intérpretes, estudios, galerías, canales) y su orden."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælg, hvilke rækker Hjem viser – scener, kunstnere, studier, gallerier, kanaler – og deres rækkefølge."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ホームに表示する行（シーン、出演者、スタジオ、ギャラリー、チャンネル）とその順序を選択します。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierz, które wiersze pokazuje ekran Start — sceny, aktorzy, studia, galerie, kanały — i w jakiej kolejności."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli quali righe mostra la Home (scene, performer, studi, gallerie, canali) e il loro ordine."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose which rows Home shows — scenes, performers, studios, galleries, Channels — and their order."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle, welche Zeilen Start zeigt – Szenen, Darsteller, Studios, Galerien, Kanäle – und ihre Reihenfolge."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisissez les rangées affichées sur l'accueil — scènes, performeurs, studios, galeries, chaînes — et leur ordre."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg hvilke rader Hjem viser – scener, utøvere, studioer, gallerier, kanaler – og rekkefølgen deres."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"홈에 표시할 행(영상, 배우, 스튜디오, 갤러리, 채널)과 순서를 선택하세요."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kies welke rijen Home toont – scènes, performers, studio's, galerijen, kanalen – en hun volgorde."}}}},"hint_choose_whose_profile_picture_this":{"localizations":{"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выберите, чьим изображением профиля станет это изображение."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli di chi diventa l'immagine del profilo."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"この画像を誰のプロフィール写真にするか選択してください。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle, wessen Profilbild dieses Bild wird."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg hvem som får dette bildet som profilbilde."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha de quem 