k tilbake."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"任意。応答がある場合（自宅のネットワークなど）は、上のアドレスの代わりに使用されます。自動的に切り替わります。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Optional. Wird statt der Adresse oben verwendet, sobald sie antwortet, etwa in deinem Heimnetz. Wechselt automatisch zurück."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"可选。只要该地址有响应（例如在家庭网络中），就会代替上方地址使用。会自动回退。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"İsteğe bağlı. Yanıt verdiği sürece, örneğin ev ağında, yukarıdaki adres yerine kullanılır. Otomatik olarak geri döner."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選填。只要能連上，就會取代上方的位址，例如在你的家用網路中。連不上時會自動改用原位址。"}}}},"hint_original_could_not_be_played":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"無法播放原始檔 — 改用伺服器轉檔"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Orijinal oynatılamadı — sunucu dönüştürmesi kullanılıyor"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"无法播放原始文件 — 正在使用服务器转码"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Original could not be played — using the server transcode"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Impossibile riprodurre l'originale: uso della transcodifica del server"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"オリジナルを再生できませんでした — サーバーのトランスコードを使用します"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"No se pudo reproducir el original; se usa la transcodificación del servidor"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"원본을 재생할 수 없습니다 — 서버 트랜스코드를 사용합니다"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Origineel kon niet worden afgespeeld – de servertranscode wordt gebruikt"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Originalet kunde inte spelas – använder serverns omkodning"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nie można odtworzyć oryginału — używane jest transkodowanie serwera"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"L'original n'a pas pu être lu — utilisation du transcodage du serveur"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Originalen kunne ikke spilles av – bruker serverens transkoding"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Original konnte nicht abgespielt werden – Server-Transcode wird verwendet"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Não foi possível reproduzir o original — usando a transcodificação do servidor"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Originalen kunne ikke afspilles – bruger serverens omkodning"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Не удалось воспроизвести оригинал — используется перекодировка сервера"}}}},"hint_other_names_for_this_tag":{"localizations":{"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Inne nazwy tego tagu. Przesuń w lewo, aby usunąć."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Другие названия этого тега. Смахните влево, чтобы удалить."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 태그의 다른 이름입니다. 제거하려면 왼쪽으로 쓸어넘기세요."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Andra namn på taggen. Svep åt vänster för att ta bort ett."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Autres noms de cette étiquette. Balayez vers la gauche pour en retirer un."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Other names for this tag. Swipe left to remove one."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Andre navn på denne taggen. Sveip til venstre for å fjerne ett."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Andre navne for dette tag. Stryg til venstre for at fjerne et."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Andere namen voor dit label. Veeg naar links om er een te verwijderen."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"このタグの別名です。左にスワイプして削除します。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Andere Namen für diesen Tag. Nach links wischen, um einen zu entfernen."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Altri nomi per questo tag. Scorri a sinistra per rimuoverne uno."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Otros nombres de esta etiqueta. Desliza a la izquierda para quitar uno."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Outros nomes para esta etiqueta. Deslize para a esquerda para remover um."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此标签的其他名称。向左轻扫可移除。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此標籤的其他名稱。向左滑動即可移除。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu etiketin diğer adları. Birini kaldırmak için sola kaydır."}}}},"hint_payment_is_charged_to_your":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"费用将从你的 Apple 账户扣除。除非在当前周期结束前至少 24 小时取消，否则订阅将自动续订。可随时在 App Store 设置中管理或取消。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"款項將從你的 Apple ID 扣款。除非在期間結束前至少 24 小時取消，否則訂閱會自動續訂。你可隨時在 App Store 設定中管理或取消。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ödeme Apple Kimliğin'den alınır. Abonelikler, dönem bitmeden en az 24 saat önce iptal edilmezse otomatik olarak yenilenir. App Store ayarlarından istediğin zaman yönet veya iptal et."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Płatność zostanie pobrana z Twojego Apple ID. Subskrypcje odnawiają się automatycznie, chyba że zostaną anulowane co najmniej 24 godziny przed końcem okresu. Zarządzaj nimi lub anuluj w dowolnym momencie w ustawieniach App Store."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Оплата списывается с вашего Apple ID. Подписка продлевается автоматически, если не отменить ее как минимум за 24 часа до конца периода. Управлять подпиской или отменить ее можно в любое время в настройках App Store."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O pagamento é cobrado no seu Apple ID. As assinaturas são renovadas automaticamente, a menos que sejam canceladas pelo menos 24 horas antes do fim do período. Gerencie ou cancele quando quiser nos ajustes da App Store."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Il pagamento viene addebitato sul tuo ID Apple. Gli abbonamenti si rinnovano automaticamente se non vengono annullati almeno 24 ore prima della fine del periodo. Gestiscili o annullali quando vuoi nelle impostazioni dell'App Store."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalningen debiteras ditt Apple-ID. Prenumerationer förnyas automatiskt om de inte avslutas minst 24 timmar innan perioden slutar. Hantera eller avsluta när som helst i dina App Store-inställningar."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Die Zahlung wird über deine Apple-ID abgerechnet. Abos verlängern sich automatisch, wenn sie nicht mindestens 24 Stunden vor Ablauf des Zeitraums gekündigt werden. Verwalten oder kündigen jederzeit in deinen App-Store-Einstellungen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"El pago se carga en tu Apple ID. Las suscripciones se renuevan automáticamente salvo que se cancelen al menos 24 horas antes de que termine el periodo. Gestiónalas o cancélalas cuando quieras en los ajustes del App Store."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalingen belastes Apple-ID-en din. Abonnementer fornyes automatisk med mindre de avsluttes minst 24 timer før perioden slutter. Administrer eller avslutt når som helst i App Store-innstillingene."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalingen trækkes på dit Apple-id. Abonnementer fornyes automatisk, medmindre de opsiges mindst 24 timer før periodens udløb. Administrer eller opsig når som helst i dine App Store-indstillinger."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"お支払いはApple IDに請求されます。サブスクリプションは期間終了の24時間以上前に解約しない限り自動更新されます。App Storeの設定でいつでも管理または解約できます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"결제 금액은 Apple ID로 청구됩니다. 구독 기간이 끝나기 최소 24시간 전에 취소하지 않으면 구독이 자동으로 갱신됩니다. 언제든지 App Store 설정에서 관리하거나 취소할 수 있습니다."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De betaling wordt in rekening gebracht via je Apple ID. Abonnementen worden automatisch verlengd, tenzij je ze minstens 24 uur voor het einde van de periode opzegt. Beheer of zeg op wanneer je wilt in je App Store-instellingen."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le paiement est débité sur votre identifiant Apple. Les abonnements se renouvellent automatiquement sauf résiliation au moins 24 heures avant la fin de la période. Gérez-les ou résiliez-les à tout moment dans les réglages de l'App Store."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Payment is charged to your Apple ID. Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the period ends. Manage or cancel anytime in your App Store settings."}}}},"hint_payment_is_charged_to_your_google":{"localizations":{"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Il pagamento viene addebitato sul tuo account Google Play. Gli abbonamenti si rinnovano automaticamente se non vengono annullati. Gestiscili o annullali quando vuoi nel Play Store."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Płatność zostanie pobrana z Twojego konta Google Play. Subskrypcje odnawiają się automatycznie, chyba że zostaną anulowane. Zarządzaj nimi lub anuluj w dowolnym momencie w Sklepie Play."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Die Zahlung wird über dein Google-Play-Konto abgerechnet. Abos verlängern sich automatisch, wenn sie nicht gekündigt werden. Verwalten oder kündigen jederzeit im Play Store."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Payment is charged to your Google Play account. Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled. Manage or cancel anytime in the Play Store."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalingen belastes Google Play-kontoen din. Abonnementer fornyes automatisk med mindre de avsluttes. Administrer eller avslutt når som helst i Play Store."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"결제 금액은 Google Play 계정으로 청구됩니다. 취소하지 않으면 구독이 자동으로 갱신됩니다. 언제든지 Play 스토어에서 관리하거나 취소할 수 있습니다."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O pagamento é cobrado na sua conta do Google Play. As assinaturas são renovadas automaticamente, a menos que sejam canceladas. Gerencie ou cancele quando quiser na Play Store."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalingen trækkes på din Google Play-konto. Abonnementer fornyes automatisk, medmindre de opsiges. Administrer eller opsig når som helst i Play Butik."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Оплата списывается с вашего аккаунта Google Play. Подписка продлевается автоматически, пока ее не отменят. Управлять подпиской или отменить ее можно в любое время в Play Store."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De betaling wordt in rekening gebracht via je Google Play-account. Abonnementen worden automatisch verlengd, tenzij je ze opzegt. Beheer of zeg op wanneer je wilt in de Play Store."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"お支払いはGoogle Playアカウントに請求されます。サブスクリプションは解約しない限り自動更新されます。Playストアでいつでも管理または解約できます。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le paiement est débité sur votre compte Google Play. Les abonnements se renouvellent automatiquement sauf résiliation. Gérez-les ou résiliez-les à tout moment dans le Play Store."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"El pago se carga en tu cuenta de Google Play. Las suscripciones se renuevan automáticamente salvo que se cancelen. Gestiónalas o cancélalas cuando quieras en Play Store."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalningen debiteras ditt Google Play-konto. Prenumerationer förnyas automatiskt om de inte avslutas. Hantera eller avsluta när som helst i Play Butik."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ödeme Google Play hesabından alınır. Abonelikler iptal edilmezse otomatik olarak yenilenir. Play Store'da istediğin zaman yönet veya iptal et."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"费用将从你的 Google Play 帐户扣除。除非取消，否则订阅将自动续订。可随时在 Play 商店中管理或取消。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"款項將從你的 Google Play 帳戶扣款。除非取消，否則訂閱會自動續訂。你可隨時在 Play 商店中管理或取消。"}}}},"hint_pick_accent_color_used_for":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择用于整个 App 中焦点高亮和图标的强调色。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇整個 App 中焦點醒目提示和圖像所使用的強調色。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Uygulama genelinde odak vurguları ve simgeler için kullanılan vurgu rengini seç."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisissez la couleur d'accentuation utilisée pour la mise en évidence et les icônes dans toute l'app."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha a cor de destaque usada nos destaques de foco e ícones em todo o app."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выберите цвет акцента для выделения фокуса и значков во всем приложении."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg aksentfargen som brukes for fokusmarkering og ikoner i hele appen."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj accentfärgen för fokusmarkeringar och symboler i hela appen."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kies de accentkleur voor focusmarkeringen en symbolen in de hele app."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle die Akzentfarbe für Fokus-Hervorhebungen und Symbole in der ganzen App."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli il colore di accento usato per l'evidenziazione del focus e le icone in tutta l'app."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige el color de acento que se usa para resaltar el foco y los iconos en toda la app."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pick the accent color used for focus highlights and icons throughout the app."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"앱 전체에서 포커스 강조 표시와 아이콘에 사용할 강조 색상을 선택하세요."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierz kolor akcentu używany do podświetleń fokusu i ikon w całej aplikacji."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"アプリ全体のフォーカスのハイライトとアイコンに使うアクセントカラーを選択します。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælg den accentfarve, der bruges til fokusmarkeringer og ikoner i hele appen."}}}},"hint_pick_app_theme_and_accent":{"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle das App-Design und die Akzentfarbe für Fokus-Hervorhebungen und Symbole in der ganzen App."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælg apptemaet og den accentfarve, der bruges til fokusmarkeringer og ikoner i hele appen."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"アプリのテーマと、アプリ全体のフォーカスのハイライトとアイコンに使うアクセントカラーを選択します。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisissez le thème de l'app et la couleur d'accentuation utilisée pour la mise en évidence et les icônes dans toute l'app."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg apptemaet og aksentfargen som brukes for fokusmarkering og ikoner i hele appen."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kies het thema van de app en de accentkleur voor focusmarkeringen en symbolen in de hele app."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pick the app theme and the accent color used for focus highlights and icons throughout the app."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выберите тему приложения и цвет акцента для выделения фокуса и значков во всем приложении."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierz motyw aplikacji i kolor akcentu używany do podświetleń fokusu i ikon w całej aplikacji."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha o tema do app e a cor de destaque usada nos destaques de foco e ícones em todo o app."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"앱 테마와 앱 전체에서 포커스 강조 표시와 아이콘에 사용할 강조 색상을 선택하세요."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige el tema de la app y el color de acento que se usa para resaltar el foco y los iconos en toda la app."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli il tema dell'app e il colore di accento usato per l'evidenziazione del focus e le icone in tutta l'app."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj apptema och accentfärgen för fokusmarkeringar och symboler i hela appen."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择 App 主题以及用于整个 App 中焦点高亮和图标的强调色。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇 App 主題，以及整個 App 中焦點醒目提示和圖像所使用的強調色。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Uygulama temasını ve uygulama genelinde odak vurguları ve simgeler için kullanılan vurgu rengini seç."}}}},"hint_pick_performer_to_start_rise":{"localizations":{"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælg en kunstner for at starte Rise-runden"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierz aktora, aby rozpocząć rundę Rise"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выберите исполнителя, чтобы начать забег Rise"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Riseランを開始する出演者を選択"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisissez un performeur pour lancer la partie Rise"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kies een performer om de Rise-run te starten"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rise 진행을 시작할 배우를 선택하세요"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha um artista para iniciar a rodada Rise"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli un performer per iniziare la partita Rise"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle einen Darsteller, um den Rise-Lauf zu starten"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pick a performer to start the Rise run"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg en utøver for å starte Rise-runden"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige un intérprete para empezar la partida de Rise"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇一位演員以開始 Rise 回合"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rise turunu başlatmak için bir oyuncu seç"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj en stjärna för att starta Rise-omgången"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择一位演员开始 Rise 回合"}}}},"hint_picked_on_this_device_from":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"根据你的播放、O 计数和评分在此设备上挑选。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oynatmalarından, O Sayılarından ve puanlarından bu aygıtta seçildi."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"依據你的播放、O 計數和評分，在此裝置上挑選。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Op dit apparaat gekozen uit je weergaven, O-tellers en beoordelingen."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolhidas neste dispositivo a partir das suas reproduções, contagens O e avaliações."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Seleccionado en este dispositivo a partir de tus reproducciones, contadores O y valoraciones."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scelte su questo dispositivo in base a riproduzioni, contatori O e valutazioni."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Picked on this device from your plays, O Counts and ratings."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierane na tym urządzeniu na podstawie Twoich odtworzeń, liczników O i ocen."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Udvalgt på denne enhed ud fra dine afspilninger, O-tællere og bedømmelser."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"再生、Oカウント、評価をもとにこのデバイスで選ばれます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"재생, O 카운트 및 별점을 바탕으로 이 기기에서 선택했습니다."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Подобрано на этом устройстве по вашим воспроизведениям, O и рейтингам."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Utvalt på den här enheten utifrån dina uppspelningar, O-räknare och betyg."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sélectionnées sur cet appareil à partir de vos lectures, compteurs O et notes."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Auf diesem Gerät aus deinen Wiedergaben, O-Zählern und Bewertungen ausgewählt."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Valgt på denne enheten ut fra avspillinger, O-tellere og vurderinger."}}}},"hint_play_count_history_resume_point":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"伺服器上的播放次數、紀錄、續播位置和觀看時間。播放器選單可針對單一短片暫停記錄。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"服务器上的播放次数、历史记录、续播位置和观看时长。可通过播放器菜单对单个短片暂停记录。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sunucudaki oynatma sayısı, geçmiş, devam noktası ve izleme süresi. Oynatıcı menüsü bunu bir sahne için duraklatabilir."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Afspeelaantal, geschiedenis, hervatpunt en kijktijd op de server. Het spelermenu kan dit voor één scène pauzeren."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"再生回数、履歴、再開位置、再生時間をサーバーに記録します。プレーヤーメニューで1つのシーンだけ一時停止できます。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wiedergaben, Verlauf, Fortsetzungspunkt und Wiedergabezeit auf dem Server. Im Player-Menü lässt es sich für eine Szene pausieren."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nombre de lectures, historique, point de reprise et durée de visionnage sur le serveur. Le menu du lecteur permet de le suspendre pour une scène."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Liczba odtworzeń, historia, punkt wznowienia i czas oglądania na serwerze. Menu odtwarzacza może to wstrzymać dla jednej sceny."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Play count, history, resume point and watch time on the server. The player menu can pause it for one scene."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Antal afspilninger, historik, genoptagelsespunkt og afspilningstid på serveren. Afspillermenuen kan sætte det på pause for én scene."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Число воспроизведений, история, точка продолжения и время просмотра на сервере. В меню плеера это можно приостановить для одной сцены."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Número de reproducciones, historial, punto de reanudación y tiempo de reproducción en el servidor. El menú del reproductor puede pausarlo para una escena."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Antall avspillinger, historikk, gjenopptakingspunkt og seertid på serveren. Spillermenyen kan sette det på pause for én scene."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Antal visningar, historik, återupptagningspunkt och visningstid på servern. Spelarmenyn kan pausa det för en scen."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Contagem de reproduções, histórico, ponto de retomada e tempo assistido no servidor. O menu do player pode pausar isso para uma cena."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Numero di riproduzioni, cronologia, punto di ripresa e tempo di visione sul server. Il menu del player può sospenderli per una scena."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"서버의 재생 횟수, 기록, 이어서 재생 위치 및 시청 시간입니다. 플레이어 메뉴에서 영상 하나에 대해 일시 중지할 수 있습니다."}}}},"hint_plays_scenes_back_to_back":{"localizations":{"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Odtwarza sceny jedna po drugiej z wiersza ekranu Start: ostatnio wydane, ostatnio dodane lub Twoje zapisane filtry scen. Strony aktorów, studiów, tagów i grup mają własny kanał."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Plays scenes back to back from a row on Home: recently released, recently added or your saved scene filters. Performer, studio, tag and group pages get their own channel."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Воспроизводит подряд сцены из ряда главной: недавно вышедшие, недавно добавленные или ваши сохраненные фильтры сцен. У страниц исполнителей, студий, тегов и групп — свой канал."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ホームの行からシーンを連続再生します：最近リリース、最近追加、または保存済みシーンフィルター。出演者、スタジオ、タグ、グループのページにはそれぞれ専用のチャンネルがあります。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Afspiller scener efter hinanden fra en række på Hjem: senest udgivet, senest tilføjet eller dine gemte scenefiltre. Sider for kunstnere, studier, tags og grupper får deres egen kanal."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lit les scènes à la suite depuis une rangée de l'accueil : sorties récentes, ajouts récents ou vos filtres de scènes enregistrés. Les pages de performeur, studio, étiquette et groupe ont leur propre chaîne."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Reproduz cenas em sequência a partir de uma linha do Início: lançadas recentemente, adicionadas recentemente ou seus filtros salvos de cenas. Páginas de artistas, estúdios, etiquetas e grupos têm seu próprio canal."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Speelt scènes achter elkaar af uit een rij op Home: recent uitgebracht, recent toegevoegd of je bewaarde scènefilters. Pagina's van performers, studio's, labels en groepen krijgen hun eigen kanaal."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Riproduce scene una dopo l'altra da una riga della Home: uscite di recente, aggiunte di recente o i tuoi filtri scene salvati. Le pagine di performer, studi, tag e gruppi hanno il loro canale."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spelar scener i följd från en rad på Hem: nyligen släppta, nyligen tillagda eller dina sparade scenfilter. Sidor för stjärnor, studior, taggar och grupper får en egen kanal."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"홈의 행(최근 공개, 최근 추가 또는 저장된 영상 필터)에서 영상을 연속으로 재생합니다. 배우, 스튜디오, 태그 및 그룹 페이지에는 자체 채널이 있습니다."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spiller scener etter hverandre fra en rad på Hjem: nylig utgitt, nylig lagt til eller de lagrede scenefiltrene dine. Utøver-, studio-, tagg- og gruppesider får sin egen kanal."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spielt Szenen nacheinander aus einer Zeile auf Start: kürzlich erschienen, kürzlich hinzugefügt oder deine gespeicherten Szenenfilter. Darsteller-, Studio-, Tag- und Gruppenseiten haben einen eigenen Kanal."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Reproduce escenas una tras otra desde una fila de Inicio: estrenadas recientemente, añadidas recientemente o tus filtros de escenas guardados. Las páginas de intérpretes, estudios, etiquetas y grupos tienen su propio canal."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"连续播放主页某一行中的短片：最近发行、最近添加或你的已存短片过滤器。演员、工作室、标签和集合页面有各自的频道。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ana Sayfa'daki bir satırdan sahneleri art arda oynatır: son çıkanlar, son eklenenler veya kayıtlı sahne filtrelerin. Oyuncu, stüdyo, etiket ve grup sayfalarının kendi kanalı olur."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"從首頁的某一列連續播放短片：最近發行、最近加入或你已儲存的短片篩選條件。演員、工作室、標籤和群組頁面也有各自的頻道。"}}}},"hint_please_configure_your_stash_server":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"请配置你的 Stash 服务器以开始使用。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Başlamak için Stash sunucunu yapılandır."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"請設定你的 Stash 伺服器以開始使用。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Konfigurera din Stash-server för att komma igång."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"시작하려면 Stash 서버를 구성하세요."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Konfigurer Stash-serveren din for å komme i gang."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Konfigurer din Stash-server for at komme i gang."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stel je Stash-server in om te beginnen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Configura tu servidor Stash para empezar."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Для начала настройте сервер Stash."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Richte deinen Stash-Server ein, um loszulegen."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Please configure your Stash server to get started."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skonfiguruj serwer Stash, aby rozpocząć."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Configure seu servidor Stash para começar."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"始めるにはStashサーバーを設定してください。"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Configura il tuo server Stash per iniziare."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Configurez votre serveur Stash pour commencer."}}}},"hint_please_enable_dashboard_performers_studios":{"localizations":{"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Schakel Dashboard, Performers, Studio's, Labels, Groepen of Markeringen in bij Instellingen"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Slå på Dashboard, Utøvere, Studioer, Tagger, Grupper eller Markører i Innstillinger"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aktivera Dashboard, Stjärnor, Studior, Taggar, Grupper eller Markörer i Inställningar"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"설정에서 Dashboard, 배우, 스튜디오, 태그, 그룹 또는 마커를 활성화하세요"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Включите в настройках Dashboard, исполнителей, студии, теги, группы или маркеры"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ative Dashboard, Artistas, Estúdios, Etiquetas, Grupos ou Marcadores em Ajustes"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Attiva Dashboard, Performer, Studi, Tag, Gruppi o Marcatori in Impostazioni"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Activa Dashboard, Intérpretes, Estudios, Etiquetas, Grupos o Marcadores en Ajustes"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Włącz w Ustawieniach Dashboard, Aktorów, Studia, Tagi, Grupy lub Znaczniki"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Please enable Dashboard, Performers, Studios, Tags, Groups or Markers in Settings"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Activez Dashboard, Performeurs, Studios, Étiquettes, Groupes ou Marqueurs dans les réglages"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aktiviere Dashboard, Darsteller, Studios, Tags, Gruppen oder Marker in den Einstellungen"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"設定でDashboard、出演者、スタジオ、タグ、グループ、マーカーのいずれかを有効にしてください"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Slå Dashboard, Kunstnere, Studier, Tags, Grupper eller Markører til i Indstillinger"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"请在设置中启用 Dashboard、演员、工作室、标签、集合或标记"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ayarlar'da Dashboard, Oyuncular, Stüdyolar, Etiketler, Gruplar veya İşaretçiler'i aç"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"請在「設定」中啟用 Dashboard、演員、工作室、標籤、群組或標記"}}}},"hint_premium_features_including_channels_continuous":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"高级功能，包括频道 — 连续播放某位演员、工作室、标签或已存过滤器的内容。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"進階功能，包括頻道 — 連續播放某位演員、工作室、標籤或已儲存篩選條件的內容。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kanallar dahil premium özellikler — bir oyuncu, stüdyo, etiket veya kayıtlı filtrenin kesintisiz oynatılması."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"채널(배우, 스튜디오, 태그 또는 저장된 필터의 연속 재생)을 포함한 프리미엄 기능."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Premium features, including Channels — continuous playback of a performer, studio, tag or saved filter."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Funzioni premium, inclusi i Canali: riproduzione continua di un performer, studio, tag o filtro salvato."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Funkcje premium, w tym kanały — ciągłe odtwarzanie aktora, studia, tagu lub zapisanego filtra."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premiumfunktioner, bland annat Kanaler – kontinuerlig uppspelning av en stjärna, studio, tagg eller ett sparat filter."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Премиум-функции, включая каналы — непрерывное воспроизведение исполнителя, студии, тега или сохраненного фильтра."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premiumfunktioner, herunder Kanaler – fortløbende afspilning af en kunstner, et studie, et tag eller et gemt filter."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premium-Funktionen, darunter Kanäle – fortlaufende Wiedergabe eines Darstellers, Studios, Tags oder gespeicherten Filters."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Funciones premium, como Canales: reproducción continua de un intérprete, estudio, etiqueta o filtro guardado."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"チャンネル（出演者、スタジオ、タグ、保存済みフィルターの連続再生）などのプレミアム機能。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fonctions premium, dont les chaînes — lecture continue d'un performeur, studio, étiquette ou filtre enregistré."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premiumfuncties, waaronder Kanalen – doorlopend afspelen van een performer, studio, label of bewaard filter."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Recursos premium, incluindo Canais — reprodução contínua de um artista, estúdio, etiqueta ou filtro salvo."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premiumfunksjoner, inkludert kanaler – kontinuerlig avspilling av en utøver, et studio, en tagg eller et lagret filter."}}}},"hint_purchase_pending_it_unlocks_once":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Purchase pending — it unlocks once payment completes."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Compra pendiente: se desbloqueará cuando se complete el pago."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Købet afventer – det låses op, når betalingen er gennemført."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"購入は保留中です — 支払いが完了するとロック解除されます。"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Покупка ожидает — доступ откроется после оплаты."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zakup oczekuje — zostanie odblokowany po zakończeniu płatności."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"구입 대기 중 — 결제가 완료되면 잠금 해제됩니다."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Köpet väntar – det låses upp när betalningen är klar."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Acquisto in sospeso: verrà sbloccato al completamento del pagamento."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kauf ausstehend – wird freigeschaltet, sobald die Zahlung abgeschlossen ist."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aankoop in behandeling – wordt ontgrendeld zodra de betaling is voltooid."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Achat en attente — le déblocage a lieu une fois le paiement effectué."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Compra pendente — será desbloqueado quando o pagamento for concluído."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kjøpet venter – det låses opp når betalingen er fullført."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"購買處理中 — 付款完成後即會解鎖。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"购买待处理 — 付款完成后即可解锁。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Satın alma bekliyor — ödeme tamamlanınca kilidi açılır."}}}},"hint_puts_performers_against_each_other":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Araçlar'da oyuncuları karşı karşıya getirir. Kazananı sen seçersin ve puanları sunucunda güncellenir."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ställer stjärnor mot varandra i Verktyg. Du väljer vinnaren och deras betyg uppdateras på servern."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在“工具”中让演员两两对决。你选出胜者，其评分会在你的服务器上更新。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在「工具」中讓演員互相對決。由你選出勝者，其評分會在你的伺服器上更新。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zet performers tegen elkaar op in Tools. Jij kiest de winnaar en hun beoordelingen worden op je server bijgewerkt."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mette i performer uno contro l'altro in Strumenti. Scegli tu il vincitore e le loro valutazioni vengono aggiornate sul server."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Puts performers against each other in Tools. You pick the winner and their ratings update on your server."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sætter kunstnere op mod hinanden i Værktøjer. Du vælger vinderen, og deres bedømmelser opdateres på din server."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Enfrenta a intérpretes entre sí en Herramientas. Tú eliges al ganador y sus valoraciones se actualizan en tu servidor."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"도구에서 배우끼리 대결시킵니다. 승자를 고르면 서버의 별점이 업데이트됩니다."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Setter utøvere opp mot hverandre i Verktøy. Du velger vinneren, og vurderingene oppdateres på serveren."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Coloca artistas uns contra os outros em Ferramentas. Você escolhe o vencedor e as avaliações deles são atualizadas no seu servidor."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oppose des performeurs les uns aux autres dans Outils. Vous choisissez le gagnant et leurs notes sont mises à jour sur votre serveur."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ツールで出演者同士を対戦させます。勝者を選ぶと、サーバー上の評価が更新されます。"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Сталкивает исполнителей друг с другом в «Инструментах». Вы выбираете победителя, а их рейтинги обновляются на сервере."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zestawia aktorów ze sobą w Narzędziach. Wybierasz zwycięzcę, a ich oceny aktualizują się na serwerze."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lässt in Werkzeuge Darsteller gegeneinander antreten. Du wählst den Gewinner, und ihre Bewertungen werden auf deinem Server aktualisiert."}}}},"hint_puts_performers_against_each_other_under":{"localizations":{"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oppose des performeurs les uns aux autres dans Découvrir. Vous choisissez le gagnant et leurs notes sont mises à jour sur votre serveur."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Coloca artistas uns contra os outros em Descobrir. Você escolhe o vencedor e as avaliações deles são atualizadas no seu servidor."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mette i performer uno contro l'altro in Scopri. Scegli tu il vincitore e le loro valutazioni vengono aggiornate sul server."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ställer stjärnor mot varandra under Upptäck. Du väljer vinnaren och deras betyg uppdateras på servern."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「見つける」で出演者同士を対戦させます。勝者を選ぶと、サーバー上の評価が更新されます。"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Сталкивает исполнителей друг с другом в разделе «Открытия». Вы выбираете победителя, а их рейтинги обновляются на сервере."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sætter kunstnere op mod hinanden under Opdag. Du vælger vinderen, og deres bedømmelser opdateres på din server."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Enfrenta a intérpretes entre sí en Descubrir. Tú eliges al ganador y sus valoraciones se actualizan en tu servidor."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Puts performers against each other under Discover. You pick the winner and their ratings update on your server."}},"pl":{"str