stashy+ will be locked on this device until you enter the key again."}}}},"hint_stashy_uses_components_above_their":{"localizations":{"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy는 위의 구성 요소를 사용합니다. 해당 라이선스는 stashy 자체 약관에 추가로 적용됩니다."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy korzysta z powyższych komponentów. Ich licencje obowiązują dodatkowo do warunków stashy."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy usa los componentes anteriores. Sus licencias se aplican además de las condiciones propias de stashy."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy bruger komponenterne ovenfor. Deres licenser gælder ud over stashys egne vilkår."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"stashy uses the components above. Their licenses apply in addition to stashy's own terms."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashyは上記のコンポーネントを使用しています。それらのライセンスはstashy自体の規約に加えて適用されます。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy utilise les composants ci-dessus. Leurs licences s'appliquent en plus des conditions propres à stashy."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy bruker komponentene ovenfor. Lisensene deres gjelder i tillegg til stashys egne vilkår."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy usa i componenti qui sopra. Le loro licenze si applicano in aggiunta ai termini di stashy."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy gebruikt de bovenstaande componenten. Hun licenties gelden naast de eigen voorwaarden van stashy."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy использует перечисленные выше компоненты. Их лицензии действуют в дополнение к условиям stashy."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy använder komponenterna ovan. Deras licenser gäller utöver stashys egna villkor."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O stashy usa os componentes acima. As licenças deles s